Package: neat-syspro
Architecture: all
Depends: neat-files (= ${binary:Version}),
         neat-taskmanager (= ${binary:Version}),
         neat-remote (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Files, Task Manager and Remote, from Wild OS, for a plain KDE desktop
 Installs all three Neat apps: Files, Task Manager and Remote.

