Package: neat-files
Architecture: any
Depends: neat-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
         kio6,
         udisks2,
         python3,
         qml6-module-qtmultimedia,
         qml6-module-qtquick-pdf,
         qt6-image-formats-plugins,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ark,
            kio-extras,
            bubblewrap,
            libimage-exiftool-perl,
            qpdf,
            python3-mutagen
Description: File manager laid out like File Explorer
 Tabs in the title bar, a breadcrumb address bar, a command bar, and the
 Recycle Bin, Home folders and drives in the sidebar. Folders are read and
 changed through KIO.

Package: neat-taskmanager
Architecture: any
Depends: neat-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
         ksystemstats,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Task Manager: processes, performance, startup apps and services
 See and end what is running, and how hard the computer is working.

Package: neat-remote
Architecture: any
Depends: neat-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
         openssh-client,
         qt6-wayland,
         ${qt6:PrivateDepends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: SSH terminal, SFTP and Remote Desktop client
 Hosts, keys, snippets and port forwarding for SSH, with a file browser over
 SFTP, and Remote Desktop (RDP) sessions through FreeRDP.
